  "details": "Since the index controllers override all the fingers that you set up in unity it would be nice is there was a toggle in the menu that allowed you to use your hang gesture override that you created in unity (for example: if you are holding an object with the index controllers your hands are not around whatever the object is you are holding because of the finger override) thats why i feel it would be nice to be able to use your unity finger set up rather then the index ones for gestures so holding whatever you put in your hand on your model doesnt look as bad",
